          "message": {
            "text": "Per-stack language now wins on Domotion’s side exactly where it wins on Chrome’s probe cells. The same effective tag reaches generic-primary resolution, fallback-chain construction, cache rebuilds, and per-codepoint fallback; the narrow live oracle exercised all 351 distance-0/1 stacks at U+0041 and reported 351 comparisons with zero mismatches.",
            "markdown": "Per-stack language now wins on Domotion’s side exactly where it wins on Chrome’s probe cells. The same effective tag reaches generic-primary resolution, fallback-chain construction, cache rebuilds, and per-codepoint fallback; the narrow live oracle exercised all 351 distance-0/1 stacks at U+0041 and reported 351 comparisons with zero mismatches."
          },
          "locations": [
